    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064220250112
    m_Localized: Share this address on your local network. Playing over the internet
      needs port 7770 forwarded on the host router.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064220250113
    m_Localized: COPY ADDRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444416
    m_Localized: The host session is already full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444417
    m_Localized: INVITE A FRIEND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444418
    m_Localized: No other explorers are connected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444419
    m_Localized: (you)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444420
    m_Localized: A co-op session is already starting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444421
    m_Localized: Already bound to {0}. The change was reverted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8332064224444422
    m_Localized: Select a control to rebind it. Escape cancels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
